{"3954090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "134 and counting", "steam_appid": 3954090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>134 and Counting</strong> is an <strong>anti-cozy</strong> space game about transporting a mysterious artifact that refuses to obey the laws of physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You pilot a ship carrying the <strong>unstable object</strong> on a balancing platform while expanding space infrastructure and manufacturing equipment through corporate factory minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tools are unreliable, the pressure is constant, and you are still expected to get the job done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a crew fails, the mission continues with the next one — and the environment becomes <strong>more hostile</strong> with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/89802e7e6e202b1bb15dc3c78de3c5bc.poster.avif?t=1779280746\" width=360 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/89802e7e6e202b1bb15dc3c78de3c5bc.webm?t=1779280746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/89802e7e6e202b1bb15dc3c78de3c5bc.mp4?t=1779280746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Balance the Artifact</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The artifact sits on a balancing platform that <strong>must be constantly stabilized</strong> during flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn, collision, or environmental disturbance can push it out of balance — and losing control means losing the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/1f72db956667f34eb2280a9fb343e119.poster.avif?t=1779280746\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/1f72db956667f34eb2280a9fb343e119.webm?t=1779280746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/1f72db956667f34eb2280a9fb343e119.mp4?t=1779280746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand SafeSpace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous crystals emit unstable energy that disrupts nearby space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only ships carrying the artifact can safely approach them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build containment platforms around these crystals to suppress their energy and create SafeSpace zones where corporate drones can operate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/db05847d4673c5a101aab7091d1c5941.poster.avif?t=1779280746\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/db05847d4673c5a101aab7091d1c5941.webm?t=1779280746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/db05847d4673c5a101aab7091d1c5941.mp4?t=1779280746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manufacture Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your equipment is manufactured in corporate factories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the production process in short minigames to produce higher-quality FPV shells and improve future production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/5da681a0b7761d569fe17565cc66c734.poster.avif?t=1779280746\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/5da681a0b7761d569fe17565cc66c734.webm?t=1779280746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/5da681a0b7761d569fe17565cc66c734.mp4?t=1779280746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research Experimental Technology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research centers provide <strong>experimental prototypes</strong> rather than finished upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly with these unstable systems in real missions to prove they work before they become permanent improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/7e0bbb26b3b75b930188fe35ce826ac6.poster.avif?t=1779280746\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/7e0bbb26b3b75b930188fe35ce826ac6.webm?t=1779280746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/7e0bbb26b3b75b930188fe35ce826ac6.mp4?t=1779280746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escalating Hazard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe and progress steadily, or take bigger risks to gain faster results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every failed attempt makes the surrounding space more dangerous for the next crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many crews will it take to finish the mission?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>134 and Counting</strong> is an <strong>anti-cozy</strong> space game about transporting a mysterious artifact that refuses to obey the laws of physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You pilot a ship carrying the <strong>unstable object</strong> on a balancing platform while expanding space infrastructure and manufacturing equipment through corporate factory minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tools are unreliable, the pressure is constant, and you are still expected to get the job done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a crew fails, the mission continues with the next one — and the environment becomes <strong>more hostile</strong> with every attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/89802e7e6e202b1bb15dc3c78de3c5bc.poster.avif?t=1779280746\" width=360 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/89802e7e6e202b1bb15dc3c78de3c5bc.webm?t=1779280746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/extras/89802e7e6e202b1bb15dc3c78de3c5bc.mp4?t=1779280746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Balance the Artifact</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The artifact sits on a balancing platform that <strong>must be constantly stabilized</strong> during flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn, collision, or environmental disturbance can push it out of balance — and losing control means losing the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline post