aph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Transport a hostile artifact on a fragile balancing platform. Build infrastructure, test experimental systems, and survive — or be replaced by the next crew.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/87f13566f4f7f4eb6c22453d77fa409308bc142c/header.jpg?t=1779280746", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/4a5bd55fc486b76c556b8fca77f7910fc3b6bc2a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779280746", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/4a5bd55fc486b76c556b8fca77f7910fc3b6bc2a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779280746", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-8300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 280 / Intel Iris Xe<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Glass Of Cat"], "publishers": ["Glass Of Cat"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/89968d46bb26af8542b6b0936c416ff71e3493cc/ss_89968d46bb26af8542b6b0936c416ff71e3493cc.600x338.jpg?t=1779280746", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954090/89968d46bb26